# High-Risk Files

Avoid changing these files unless the task clearly requires it:

- `packages/excalidraw/scene/Renderer.ts` — render pipeline
- `packages/excalidraw/data/restore.ts` — file format compat
- `packages/excalidraw/actions/manager.tsx` — action system
- `packages/excalidraw/types.ts` — core types
- `packages/excalidraw/components/App.tsx` — editor orchestration and lifecycle hub

Changes here require:

1. Reading dependent call sites and nearby tests first
2. Running focused tests and type checks for the touched behavior when feasible
3. Explaining the risk in the final summary if one of these files changed
